---
/**
 * MobileHardwareSection — CameraX & ML Kit Hardware Scanning with Mandatory Manual Fallback
 * Directly adheres to ADR-0018 and field ruggedization constraints.
 */
---

<div class="hardware-container" id="sec-hardware-camerax" data-platform-target="kotlin">
  <section class="spec-card">
    <div class="card-header-row">
      <div class="card-badge-icon hardware-badge"><i class="pi pi-qrcode"></i></div>
      <div>
        <span class="card-eyebrow">HARDWARE MÓVIL · CAMERAX & ML KIT</span>
        <h3 class="card-title">Escaneo Óptico en Campo con Fallback Manual Obligatorio</h3>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="card-text">
      En operaciones logísticas y de almacén (Operations Android), los conductores y operarios deben validar guías de despacho y códigos de activos en contenedores. El sistema implementa <strong>CameraX + ML Kit Barcode Scanning</strong> junto con integración a escáneres láser industriales (Zebra DataWedge via Android Intents).
    </p>

    <!-- Fallback Requirement Box -->
    <div class="field-rule-banner">
      <div class="rule-icon"><i class="pi pi-exclamation-circle"></i></div>
      <div class="rule-text">
        <strong>Mandato Arquitectónico (ADR-0018): Fallback Manual Obligatorio</strong>
        <p>Bajo ninguna circunstancia la imposibilidad de escanear (código físico con manchas de grasa, roto, o falta de luz en tolva) puede detener la operativa de despacho. La pantalla de escáner debe ofrecer <em>siempre</em> un campo de texto numérico de 48dp con teclado numérico ampliado para validación manual de la guía.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Live Scanner Architecture Specimen -->
    <div class="scanner-specimen-layout">
      <div class="scanner-mock-view">
        <div class="cam-lens-header">
          <span><i class="pi pi-camera"></i> CameraX 1.4 PreviewView</span>
          <span class="fps-tag">60 FPS · QR/Code128</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cam-lens-body">
          <div class="reticle-box">
            <div class="reticle-laser"></div>
            <span class="reticle-text">Alinee guía física aquí</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="scanner-fallback-panel">
        <span class="panel-kicker">INTERFAZ DE CONTINGENCIA</span>
        <h4 class="panel-title">Entrada Manual Inmediata</h4>
        <p class="panel-desc">Disponible en todo momento sin salir del flujo de escaneo:</p>

        <div class="manual-input-box">
          <label>Código de Guía de Despacho (10 dígitos)</label>
          <div class="input-action-row">
            <input type="text" value="ORD-2026-9812-A" readonly />
            <button type="button" class="btn-validate">
              <i class="pi pi-check"></i> Validar
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hardware-specs-list">
          <div class="spec-pill-item">
            <i class="pi pi-bolt"></i> Linterna Flash Integrada
          </div>
          <div class="spec-pill-item">
            <i class="pi pi-tablet"></i> Soporte Zebra DataWedge
          </div>
          <div class="spec-pill-item">
            <i class="pi pi-volume-up"></i> Pitido y Haptic Feedback
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<style>
  .hardware-container {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .spec-card {
    background: var(--nexa-surface-card, #ffffff);
    border: 1px solid var(--nexa-color-border-structural, #e2e8f0);
    border-radius: var(--nexa-radius-card, 16px);
    padding: 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    scroll-margin-top: 80px;
  }

  .card-header-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .card-badge-icon.hardware-badge {
    width: 38px;
    height: 38px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: #f3e8ff;
    color: #7f52ff;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 17px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .card-eyebrow {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: #7f52ff;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .card-title {
    font-family: var(--nexa-font-family-display, sans-serif);
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--nexa-color-text-primary, #0f172a);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .card-text {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--nexa-color-text-secondary, #64748b);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .field-rule-banner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    background: #fffbeb;
    border: 1px solid #fde68a;
    border-radius: 12px;
    color: #92400e;
  }

  .rule-icon {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: #d97706;
    margin-top: 2px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .rule-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;

    strong {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #78350f;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin: 0;
      color: #92400e;
    }
  }

  .scanner-specimen-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 240px 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #f8fafc;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .scanner-specimen-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .scanner-mock-view {
    background: #090e17;
    color: #ffffff;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 12px;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .cam-lens-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-family: var(--nexa-font-family-mono, monospace);
  }

  .fps-tag {
    color: #22c55e;
  }

  .cam-lens-body {
    flex: 1;
    min-height: 160px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #172554 0%, #030712 100%);
    border-radius: 8px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .reticle-box {
    width: 140px;
    height: 140px;
    border: 2px dashed #38c8ff;
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .reticle-laser {
    width: 90%;
    height: 2px;
    background: #38c8ff;
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px #38c8ff;
    position: absolute;
    animation: laserScan 2s infinite alternate;
  }

  @keyframes laserScan {
    0% { top: 15%; }
    100% { top: 85%; }
  }

  .reticle-text {
    font-size: 9px;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -20px;
  }

  .scanner-fallback-panel {
    padding: 18px 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .panel-kicker {
    font-size: 9.5px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: #d97706;
  }

  .panel-title {
    font-family: var(--nexa-font-family-display, sans-serif);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #0f172a;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .panel-desc {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: #64748b;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .manual-input-box {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-top: 6px;

    label {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #475569;
    }
  }

  .input-action-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;

    input {
      flex: 1;
      height: 48px;
      padding: 0 12px;
      border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-family: var(--nexa-font-family-mono, monospace);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      background: #f8fafc;
      color: #0f172a;
      outline: none;
    }
  }

  .btn-validate {
    height: 48px;
    padding: 0 18px;
    background: var(--nexa-color-primary-600, #2a67d9);
    color: #ffffff;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 13px;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;

    &:hover {
      background: #1d4ed8;
    }
  }

  .hardware-specs-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .spec-pill-item {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #334155;
    background: #f1f5f9;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;

    i {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #2a67d9;
    }
  }
</style>
